From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: QinCai-rui <git@qincai.xyz>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 06:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] iommu: sunxi: accept the previous domain in attach_dev

Match the updated attach_dev callback signature, which passes the
previous domain as an additional argument. Keep the existing no-op
callback behavior unchanged.

---
diff --git a/bsp/drivers/iommu/sunxi-iommu-v2.c b/bsp/drivers/iommu/sunxi-iommu-v2.c
--- a/bsp/drivers/iommu/sunxi-iommu-v2.c
+++ b/bsp/drivers/iommu/sunxi-iommu-v2.c
@@ -864,7 +864,8 @@
 }
 
 static int sunxi_iommu_attach_dev(struct iommu_domain *domain,
-				  struct device *dev)
+				  struct device *dev,
+				  struct iommu_domain *old)
 {
 	return 0;
 }
